Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|
		|pageName|Wiki Page|
		|portletName|Wiki|
		|workflowAssetType|Wiki Page|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Workflow Configuration|
	And Workflow configure Workflow
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
		|workflowResourceValue|Wiki Page|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Wiki Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Wiki|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Approve Front Page User Edit
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Members
		|portlet|Site Memberships|
	And Site assign User As Member CP
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Page|
	And WikiPage add Front Page With Workflow PG
		|wikiPageContent|Front Page Wiki Content|
	And UserBar goto My Account
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Submissions|
	And Workflow view My Submissions
		|workflowAssetTitle|FrontPage|
		|workflowAssetType|Wiki Page|
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|FrontPage|
		|workflowAssetType|Wiki Page|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow approve Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|FrontPage|
		|workflowAssetType|Wiki Page|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Page|
	And WikiPage view Front Page PG
		|wikiNodeName|FrontPage|
		|wikiPageContent|Front Page Wiki Content|
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
	And UserBar goto My Account
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Submissions|
	And Workflow view Cannot Withdraw Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|FrontPage|
		|workflowAssetType|Wiki Page|
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver|
		|workflowTask|Approved|
	Then User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
