Scenario: Reject Wiki Page PG
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Page|
	When WikiNavigator goto All Pages PG
	And WikiPage add Page With Workflow PG
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Page Content|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
		|wikiPageUsername|Test Test|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto Draft Pages PG
	And WikiPage view Page With Workflow PG
		|wikiPageStatus|Pending|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
		|wikiPageUsername|Test Test|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Wiki Page Title|
		|workflowAssetType|Wiki Page|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow reject Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Wiki Page Title|
		|workflowAssetType|Wiki Page|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow view Rejected Task
		|workflowAssetTitle|Wiki Page Title|
		|workflowAssetType|Wiki Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto Draft Pages PG
	Then WikiPage view Page With Workflow PG
		|wikiPageStatus|Pending|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
		|wikiPageUsername|Test Test|

